        guidedPrompt = "Match each word on the left cleanly to its true RP anchor sound: (1) quay, (2) women, (3) blood, (4) gauge, (5) clerk. Choices: /ʌ/ cup, /iː/ sheep, /eɪ/ cake, /ɑː/ father, /ɪ/ sit.",
